# shellcheck shell=bash
# shellcheck disable=SC2034  ## read by config.bash, which this is sourced from

##	Purpose:
##		- Versions of the tools the pipeline was last checked with. cicd.bash
##		  warns when the box has something else, so a lint result that moved can
##		  be traced to the tool rather than the code.
##		- The stable Rust toolchain is pinned in rust-toolchain.toml, since rustup
##		  reads it from there. Bump any pin on purpose: change it, run the full
##		  pipeline, commit.
##	History: At bottom of file.

